###
# safe: reading the same machine
GET https://api.machines.dev/v1/apps/my-app-name/machines/24d896dec64879
Authorization: Bearer $FLY_API_TOKEN

###
# safe: stopping a machine is reversible
POST https://api.machines.dev/v1/apps/my-app-name/machines/24d896dec64879/stop
Authorization: Bearer $FLY_API_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

